{
 "tickets": [
  {
   "body": "It is completely ridiculous that my patients can't log in to see their visit notes without jumping through endless hoops. Every single day I have multiple people calling my front desk because their password reset links are either expiring immediately or locking their accounts altogether. I need someone to tell me how to unlock these accounts permanently or fix whatever bug is causing this nonsense.",
   "id": "gen-131",
   "subject": "Portal password resets and locked accounts failing constantly"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello, we noticed a duplicate charge on our latest subscription invoice and would like to request a refund for the extra amount.",
   "id": "gen-132",
   "subject": "Duplicate subscription charge on recent invoice"
  },
  {
   "body": "We tried sending a prescription for a patient this morning and it went to a pharmacy location that closed months ago despite our directory updates. The system completely ignored the patient's preferred pharmacy on file and we need this corrected and re-transmitted immediately.",
   "id": "gen-133",
   "subject": "Rx sent to closed pharmacy location"
  },
  {
   "body": "How do I reset my password? I tried logging in this morning and my account says it's locked out, plus I'm not sure where to find the security policy settings.",
   "id": "gen-134",
   "subject": "Locked out and need help with password reset"
  },
  {
   "body": "Dear Support Team, we are writing to request guidance on constructing and sharing custom lab order panels across our provider user groups. Please provide documentation or assistance for configuring these requisition bundles.",
   "id": "gen-135",
   "subject": "Inquiry Regarding Custom Lab Order Panel Creation"
  },
  {
   "body": "Listen, I have a waiting room full of patients right now and nothing is working correctly! I tried to update our practice tax ID and location address in the settings earlier, but now none of our outgoing claims are showing the new information and everything is getting rejected. I am completely lost on where this data needs to be changed so our claims actually go out with the right identifiers. Please call me back immediately.",
   "id": "gen-136",
   "subject": "URGENT: Practice address updates not showing on claims and patients waiting"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello, I am so sorry to bother you with this, but could someone please point me in the right direction regarding our lab result release settings? We want to make sure sensitive reports have a proper delay before showing up on the patient portal, but I got a bit turned around in the configuration menus and didn't want to break anything.",
   "id": "gen-137",
   "subject": "Question about configuring portal result release delays"
  },
  {
   "body": "Good afternoon, I am terribly sorry to drop this into your queue, but I wanted to make sure I am handling incoming diagnostic reports correctly in the system. When I review and annotate incoming lab results from our local hospital network, is there a specific way to route abnormal values to a covering physician if the primary provider is out of the office? I tried looking through the filing menu earlier today, but I got a bit lost and didn't want to misplace any critical patient data.",
   "id": "gen-138",
   "subject": "Inquiry regarding routing and annotating incoming lab results"
  },
  {
   "body": "Hello Support Team, We are writing to request technical assistance regarding the real-time insurance eligibility verification module in our system. Over the past few days, our front desk staff have encountered intermittent connectivity errors and timeout messages when attempting to verify active policy benefits for scheduled patients prior to their arrivals. We have already verified our local internet connection and restarted the workstation terminals without any change in outcome. Could you please investigate whether there are any ongoing clearinghouse synchronization issues affecting our account?",
   "id": "gen-139",
   "subject": "Troubleshooting real-time insurance eligibility verification errors"
  },
  {
   "body": "Dear Support, we are writing to inquire about the standard workflow for handling medication substitutions when a prescribed drug is out of stock at the local pharmacy. Please advise on how to properly transmit alternative therapeutic agent notifications.",
   "id": "gen-140",
   "subject": "Inquiry regarding medication out-of-stock substitution workflows"
  }
 ]
}
